models/
# `artifacts/*` rather than `artifacts/`, so git still descends into the directory and the negation
# below can take effect. A file whose parent directory is excluded cannot be re-included at all, so
# excluding the directory itself would make the exception silently do nothing.
artifacts/*
# Everything under `artifacts/` is machine-written, and most of it — fitted releases, per-day run
# bundles, demo output — is reproducible bulk that would only make the history heavy. These five are
# the exceptions, because each is evidence a reader cannot regenerate for themselves.
#
# The spent-marker first, because ADR-0018 depends on it: it is the only evidence that the single
# permitted evaluation has happened, and untracked, a fresh clone reads the holdout as unspent and
# the guard lets it be spent a second time.
!artifacts/final_holdout.json
# The other four are the measured record behind the report's figures and its Trial accounting.
# `scripts/report_figures.py` reads the first three and cannot run without them; `trials.json` is
# what makes the Trial budget auditable rather than asserted.
!artifacts/arm_comparison.json
!artifacts/bootstrap_intervals.json
!artifacts/holdout_intervals.json
!artifacts/trials.json
